    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That sounds like a strong case for transit, but some of the local business owners in the suburbs are pretty worried. They're saying that without more highway lanes, deliveries will be slowed down and people living further out won't be able to get to work easily. How would you address those concerns in the report?",
